# Bot changes → push to Railway

When bot-service or HL trail/trading logic changes are complete and build-verified:

1. Commit with a clear message (bot behavior + why).
2. Push to `origin main` without asking — Railway deploys from main.
3. Mention commit hash in the summary so deploy can be verified.

Do not wait for the user to say "push" after bot work unless they explicitly said not to deploy.

Frontend-only changes: push when the user asks or when bundled with bot changes in the same session goal.
